<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>French League Cup quarter-final</p>
<p>results on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Lens	0  Monaco			 1</p>
<p> Bordeaux     0  Caen			   0</p>
<p>(after extra time, Bordeaux won 4-2 on penalties)</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Strasbourg   5  Lounhans-Cuiseaux (II)   1</p>
<p>(a.e.t., score 1-1 at 90 mins)</p>
<p> Montpellier  2  Rennes			 1</p>
<p>(a.e.t., score 1-1 at 90 mins)</p>
</text>
